    <Descriptions>
      <Description description="The Power Platform Monitoring Framework (PPMF) provides automated error capture, alerting, and triage management for Power Automate cloud flows across any Power Platform environment.&#xA;&#xA;When a flow fails, PPMF automatically captures structured error data into Dataverse, sends a formatted alert to a configured Microsoft Teams channel, and creates a trackable error record for triage. Alert routing rules allow different solutions to target dedicated Teams channels with configurable severity thresholds.&#xA;&#xA;Key capabilities:&#xA;- Automatic error capture and Teams alerting for all monitored flows&#xA;- Dataverse-backed error record management with triage status tracking&#xA;- Solution-specific alert routing with per-route severity filtering&#xA;- Configurable retention, throttle windows, and environment identity&#xA;- Post-import configuration page with guided deployment checklist&#xA;&#xA;Designed for enterprise deployment in Commercial, GCC High, and DoD cloud environments. Compatible with managed solution distribution. Requires a Microsoft Teams connection for alert delivery." languagecode="1033" />
    </Descriptions>
